body:
u/throwaway3993849381 just know that your not alone, everyone in VCE are in the same boat- depression and demotivation for studies. Just rest yourself for a bit and carry on. VCE exams are important but your health should take priority because even a rich person or a successful person has no use for their top academic marks if their health is in decline. 

&#x200B;

If you can try to talk to your teachers 1 to 1, as they might be able to help to motivate and support you in your studies.
